OL,3,GNEWSA'This doesn't happen to us' - mum
OL,4,Aon child's cancer
OL,5,
OL,6,F"She just didn't seem as full of life
OL,7,Fas she usually was... I couldn't work
OL,8,Fout what was wrong," Sam said. "I was
OL,9,Fsearching her symptoms and leukaemia
OL,10,Fkept coming up."
